# Python bytecode: regenerated at every run of a tool, particular to the
# machine and to the interpreter's version. Nothing to keep.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# LaTeX's intermediate output. The PDFs themselves are tracked: they are
# what the site hands the reader.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc

# The decoded text, cached between two runs of the tools. Rebuilt from the
# cells when the scan is there, from content/ when it is not; particular to
# the machine, and invalidated by its own fingerprint. See _signature() in
# tools/edition.py.
work/_pages.pkl
